  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Comedian — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>When a creature you can see within 60 ft would try to teleport, avoid damage,  or  do  something  obviously  impossible  via  normal  means  while your reversal is active, you can spend 5 CE to force that creature to make  a  Cursed  Energy  saving  throw.  On  a  failed  save,  their  attempt fails and they take 2d8 psychic damage as you lecture them on realism (Eg.  You  can’t  just  dodge  a  meteor,  are  you  stupid  or  something?). Creatures without cursed energy automatically fail this saving throw.</p>",
